# Research Documents

- research-plan.md: development order, required evidence, and decisions.
- strategies/: separate notes for each strategy.
- data/: data definitions, checks, and quality reports.
- comparison/: rules for comparing strategies.
- report/: report forms copied from plutus-project-template.

The PDF and source ZIP files are blank report forms, not completed studies. Use the current Plutus V2 step names when writing new reports.

Keep private books, extracted text, and search indexes in the workspace knowledge directory. Research notes may contain permitted citations, document IDs, checksums, and conclusions.
